  "title": "BlurFilter",
  "description": "Box-blur Filter implemented as multiple additive sprite passes. The blur is approximated by rendering the input texture `quality * 2 + 1` times offset symmetrically along each axis by up to ±`radius` logical units and blending them additively. Higher `quality` values add more samples and produce a smoother result at the cost of additional draw calls.",
