          ],
          "returnType": "void",
          "description": "The blur reaches radius logical units outside its input on every edge. Read off the sampling loop rather than assumed: _drawSamples draws the input at offsets spread evenly over [-radius, +radius] along each axis separately, so the furthest an output texel's value can travel from its source is exactly radius, and only axis-aligned — the diagonal corner is covered by the box the two axes span. quality adds samples between those extremes and does not change the reach."
        },
