          "description": "Tell every node this filter is attached to that its rendered output is out of date. Call it after mutating anything that changes what the filter draws or how far it reaches — the stock filters do this from their own setters. Without it a cached or retained representation of the owning node keeps replaying the result the filter produced before the change."
